WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
OSHA 10 is not optional. You need this to work on most commercial job sites.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
CareerSafe proctored OSHA 10 final assessment covering all safety topics: Fatal
Four, fall protection, electrical safety, HazCom/GHS, confined spaces, fire
prevention, PPE, and rigging. Must pass to receive the DOL wallet card.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: The OSHA 10 card is a hiring requirement for
most HVAC employers.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Review all Fatal Four hazards. And — Know fall protection
trigger heights

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Take a minute before you move on. What's the one thing from this lesson you need
to remember on a service call?

